{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019140014248-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019173143\"/><p>消防到場破門進入單位。</p><p>沙田發生火警。今午(19日)12時25分，禾輋邨保安報案，指泰和樓一單位冒出濃煙。救援人員接報到場，消防破門進入單位後發現空無一人，相信單位住戶煮食期間離開單位，忘記閂火導致煲燶食物引致火警，事件中無人受傷，起火原因無可疑。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:39:29.385792+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:00:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:57.987497+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:57.987497+00:00","content_hash":"342cb4f8e41e18ecf306705e908f31c08e75a17942f376d9f43eebebe147d88c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}